      '1. Test pyramid: many fast unit tests of logic, fewer integration tests of modules working together (database, files, HTTP boundary), and a small number of end-to-end tests of critical user journeys. Push a check down to the lowest level that can catch the bug and do not test the same thing at several levels.',
