      '2. Algorithmic complexity first: replace nested loops over the same data with a map/set lookup (O(n²) → O(n)); sort once and binary search; avoid repeated work inside loops (compute outside, memoise); stop early when the answer is known; pick the right data structure (array vs map vs set vs queue vs heap vs trie); watch quadratic string concatenation and repeated array copying.',
