      '8. Length: the video stops soon after the payoff; nothing runs on with silence or a static frame.',
      '9. Report: say what you built (length, format, number of clips), what you checked and how (video_read, which preview times), and what you could not check (real audio loudness, playback on a device, platform UI changes).',
      '10. Offer video_open to show it, and export only when asked or when the user needs the file.',
