      "## Choosing",
      "Podcast host or generic delivery: 16-bit WAV (hosts transcode). Handing to a mastering engineer: 24-bit or 32-bit float WAV, with peaks below 0 dBFS and no limiter. Video editor: 48 kHz WAV 24-bit. Web preview: webm. Keep the project at 44.1 kHz for music/CD and 48 kHz for video; convert once at the end.",
