      "# Presentation storytelling",
      "Drawn from Nancy Duarte's Resonate (contrast between what is and what could be), the Pyramid Principle (answer first) and Cole Nussbaumer Knaflic's Storytelling with Data (the big idea).",
      "## Before any slide",
