      "# Slide design principles",
      "Built on Robin Williams' CRAP principles (contrast, repetition, alignment, proximity), Garr Reynolds' Presentation Zen (simplicity, signal vs noise) and Mayer's multimedia principles (coherence, signalling, redundancy).",
      "## Hierarchy",
      "- Each slide has one focal point the eye goes to first: the biggest, boldest or most colourful thing should be the most important. If everything is emphasised, nothing is.",
